tled to 8/12 on the proper band. Book typos: greater that that, geta, eal, occurin, 1in 6. The reaction, calming and understanding prose two-way clean (1d12, two rounds, 2d3 turns, one-quarter and one mile, 20 percent and two attempts, the 50-50 motion split, +2 and +4).",
