      "name" = "wmgBarkskinHalfAbrasion",
      "value" = true,
      "comment" = "the recipient suffers half damage from abrasion when tumbling down a slope; a druid acting quickly might cast it on a character as he tumbles past, minimizing abrasion for the remainder of the distance but not offsetting damage already suffered before the spell takes effect",
