      "value" = true,
      "comment" = "if a protrusion is only a few inches out of reach the character extends the rope end as far as possible and has his magic-using companion bind the rope to the protrusion",
    }, {
      "name" = "wmgCallLtnAlwaysHit",
      "value" = true,
      "comment" = "a bolt of magical lightning will always hit a target within range of the area where it strikes, whereas the chance of being hit by natural lightning is usually quite small",
