    }, {
      "name" = "wmgCtrlWindsNegates",
      "value" = true,
      "comment" = "control winds cast to counter a control weather or control temperature spell completely negates the previous spell, reinstates the natural conditions that were in effect beforehand, and then creates a wind of the desired velocity",
