      "comment" = "the possibilities for normal familiars should be restricted to creatures that could conceivably exist within the spell range - a black cat will not be found in a desert or at a mountain summit and a toad will not be found in the middle of a grassy plain; contradictory die-roll results may be re-rolled or treated as no familiar available",
